{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <i>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 What if the next time you woke up you had no memories,\u00a0 were holding a gun and hunted by deranged people?\u00a0</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong><i>\u00a0 </i></strong><i>Find out what you're made of in this <strong>unique blend of RNG and skill-based progression</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2665020/extras/milogif_bb1.gif?t=1742761728\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Survive</strong> as long as you can and <strong>save the rats</strong> that are tormented by Milo and his followers. Leverage the corpses to empower you and survive longer</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2665020/extras/milogif_bb2.gif?t=1742761728\" /></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Compete with others in the Global Leaderboards in the <i><strong>&quot;Basketball&quot;</strong></i> mini-game flaunt your skill</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Pop the corpses</strong> and use slain cultists against their sadistic leader, Milo</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Drink</strong> from the Cream Machine to upgrade your character </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2665020/extras/COLLECT_GIF_NEW.gif?t=1742761728\" /> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2665020/extras/PLAY_GIF_REDUX.gif?t=1742761728\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2665020/extras/DRINKUPGRADE_GIF.gif?t=1742761728\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p